480092292811", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654865194_1658480095626144_8447913270395598412_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cf7zP76wKZMQ7kNvwEAZmtR&_nc_oc=Adrih_iJB9UpUhSUxLQd_Y9-JWX-4wO5BPdlpSEOrHL412Dt19Asr-asSpOXGrtjCL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTdXGI1OhoAbCadvUtTbYr_15QXNAsiYfxb2Y1DAbKkeQ&oe=6AF9B9CB"}, {"file_name": "05-coffee-and-radio.png", "id": "1327525482788392", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673522158_1327525486121725_609108412119751762_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=INQNNsLExrgQ7kNvwGE-GKc&_nc_oc=AdpG6WgVBt6SH1tHU5K6Y_P2NQsWp4dTj-R259OJIcX1V-L2_0GbaHcWqYIqhYCYdrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRJCtqgvDhBlM56PXeYTPCeLSc4SPw5eMFJeEw1YvzP0g&oe=6AF9DE52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "bolt-action-hunter-1.0-trailer-cover.png", "id": "1184429984149111", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654922264_1184429987482444_3206253754105313926_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7E0x_CGHbsIQ7kNvwGWnA19&_nc_oc=Adpvjp185Su9th8G7iyk9RsFt10zYXGcQa-AxxbS2vrFsvHqQ3UsRg7mEXsSDNgqlnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRy92Nz6G-zbixJbta4EL7X0CwqwEyj1U4_I805bRmeSg&oe=6AF9BD70"}, "display_name": "Bolt Action Hunter", "keywords": ["hunting", "shooting", "rifle", "deer", "marksman"], "long_description": "Slow down. Take aim. Enjoy the view.\n\nSettle into a hillside deck overlooking a quiet, stylized valley. Hunt at your own pace with a scoped bolt-action rifle and hunting pistol, work their physical reloads, and read the wind before you squeeze the trigger.\n\nA short optional intro teaches the rifle. Then chase bronze, silver and gold medals in 17 challenges, from long-range shots to five-round hunts, or simply enjoy Free Hunt. Choose Relaxed, Hunter or Expert: wind, aim sway, wary animals and shot placement grow with the difficulty.\n\nBetween shots, knock over cans, launch a flying disc, toss camp toys or pour yourself a coffee.\n\n- Relaxed hunting and target practice from a stationary deck.\n- Deer, boar, bison, foxes, rabbits, ducks and pheasants that hear your shots and move as herds.\n- Hands-on rifle and pistol reloads, a holdover reticle, rangefinder and red-dot pistol sight.\n- 17 challenges with medals, a trophy plaque, saved records and cosmetic upgrades earned through play.\n- Three difficulty levels, midday or golden-hour light, and a mirrored left-handed layout.\n- Adjustable table height for seated or standing play.\n- An optional spatial radio for your own local MP3, WAV and Ogg music.\n\nSingle-player. Two tracked controllers required. English. Core gameplay works offline. No ads or real-money in-game purchases.\n\nMusic files are not included. The radio requests optional audio-library access. Protected streaming downloads and other apps' private files cannot be played.", "short_description": "Unwind on a hillside hunting deck with a scoped bolt-action rifle. Hunt at your pace, chase medals in 17 challenges, or relax with target practice, camp toys, coffee and your own music."}]}, "developer_name": "Bit Universe", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bolt-action-hunter.ksavill.chatgpt.site/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bit Universe", "support_website_url": "https://bolt-action-hunter.ksavill.chatgpt.site/support/", "website_url": "https://bolt-action-hunter.ksavill.chatgpt.site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEME